                <h2><b>How iFOX Delivers Dynamics 365 Support Services</b></h2>
                <p>
                    iFOX provides Dynamics 365 support services to help organizations maintain a dependable CRM environment after implementation. Our support approach combines issue assessment, practical troubleshooting, user assistance, updates, and ongoing maintenance and optimization so your teams can continue using Dynamics 365 effectively as business needs change.
                </p>
                <ul class="list-unstyled">
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i>  Issue Assessment and Troubleshooting: Review reported symptoms, configuration, data, and recent changes to identify causes and guide practical resolution of Dynamics 365 issues.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i>  Updates and Release Readiness: Review relevant Dynamics 365 updates and assess their effect on configuration, customizations, integrations, and user processes before changes are adopted.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i>  User Assistance: Help users understand features, resolve application issues, and follow consistent processes through practical guidance and knowledge sharing.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i>  Maintenance and Optimization: Review configuration, data access, customizations, and integrations to identify improvements that support reliable application performance.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p>
                            <i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i>  Training and Knowledge Sharing: Provide practical guidance and updated support documentation so users can work confidently with changing Dynamics 365 features and processes.
                        </p>
                    </li>
                </ul><br />
                <h2><b>Practical Dynamics CRM Support for Everyday Issues</b></h2>
                <p>Effective Dynamics CRM support connects user questions and technical issues with a clear troubleshooting approach. iFOX helps investigate application behavior, clarify whether an issue relates to configuration or custom development, and identify appropriate next steps without disrupting established business processes.</p>
                <ul class="list-unstyled">
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i>  Application Support: Investigate access, form, view, workflow, data, and process issues so users receive focused guidance and resolution support.</p>
                    </li><li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i>  Clear Issue Context: Capture the affected process, users, records, steps, and observed behavior to make troubleshooting more focused and repeatable.</p>
                    </li><li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i>  Knowledge Sharing: Record useful guidance and recurring solutions so teams can handle familiar Dynamics 365 tasks more consistently.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i>  User Feedback: Use recurring questions and user feedback to identify process friction, training needs, and opportunities for application improvement.</p>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <p><i class="bi bi-check2-circle color"></i>  Structured Follow-Up: Document findings, recommended actions, and relevant configuration or development considerations for complex issues.</p>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>
